{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "b1e1e1e1-1111-2222-3333-444455556666",
    "name": "Kali Auth Context API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": "Colección de endpoints principales para Kali Auth Context."
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/health",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["health"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Login",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"usuario@correo.com\",\n  \"password\": \"contraseña123A!\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/auth/login",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
        },
        "description": "El tenant ya no se envía: el servidor lo resuelve a partir de la cuenta. Si el correo y la contraseña existen en varias empresas responde 409 {\"error\": \"company code required\"}; en ese caso usa la petición 'Login (con código de empresa)'."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Login (con código de empresa)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"usuario@correo.com\",\n  \"password\": \"contraseña123A!\",\n  \"tenant_code\": \"codigo-empresa\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/auth/login",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "login"]
        },
        "description": "Solo cuando el login sin código responde 409 company code required. tenant_code es el código legible de la empresa (3-40 minúsculas, dígitos o guiones), nunca el UUID."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "JWKS (claves públicas)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/.well-known/jwks.json",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": [".well-known", "jwks.json"]
        },
        "description": "Claves públicas RS256 que kali-invoice-service usa para validar los access tokens (AUTH_JWKS_URL)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Registrar usuario",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"tenant_id\": \"TENANT_ID\",\n  \"identification_number\": \"12345678\",\n  \"username\": \"usuario1\",\n  \"email\": \"usuario@correo.com\",\n  \"password\": \"contraseña123A!\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/users/",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", ""]
        },
        "description": "Requiere users/manage. 201 con el usuario creado (sin contraseña). tenant_id solo lo usa el administrador de plataforma para otra empresa; si se omite, se usa la del token. 400 correo vacío o contraseña débil; 409 correo duplicado en la empresa."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Obtener usuario por email",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/users/by-email?email=usuario@correo.com&tenant_id=TENANT_ID",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "users", "by-email"],
          "query": [
            { "key": "email", "value": "usuario@correo.com" },
            { "key": "tenant_id", "value": "TENANT_ID" }
          ]
        },
        "description": "Requiere users/read. La respuesta nunca incluye la contraseña ni su hash."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Authorize (protegido)",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"tenant_id\": \"TENANT_ID\",\n  \"user_id\": \"USER_ID\",\n  \"resource\": \"recurso\",\n  \"action\": \"accion\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/auth/authorize",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "authorize"]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Sesión (estado de la empresa)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/auth/session",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "auth", "session"]
        },
        "description": "200 si el token es válido y su empresa está activa; 403 tenant is suspended si la empresa fue suspendida (también con tokens emitidos antes). Lo usa kali-invoice-service."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Empresas: listar",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/tenants",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "tenants"]
        },
        "description": "Solo administrador de plataforma: usuario de la empresa de plataforma con el permiso tenants/manage (el admin sembrado lo tiene con */*). Cualquier otro usuario: 403 platform administrator required."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Empresas: crear",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Empresa Ejemplo\",\n  \"code\": \"empresa-ejemplo\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/tenants",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "tenants"]
        },
        "description": "Solo administrador de plataforma: usuario de la empresa de plataforma con el permiso tenants/manage (el admin sembrado lo tiene con */*). Cualquier otro usuario: 403 platform administrator required. El código es opcional (se deriva del nombre). 400 nombre vacío o código inválido; 409 código duplicado."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Empresas: consultar",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/tenants/{{tenant_id_objetivo}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "tenants", "{{tenant_id_objetivo}}"]
        },
        "description": "Solo administrador de plataforma: usuario de la empresa de plataforma con el permiso tenants/manage (el admin sembrado lo tiene con */*). Cualquier otro usuario: 403 platform administrator required. 404 si no existe."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Empresas: editar",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Empresa Ejemplo\",\n  \"code\": \"empresa-ejemplo\",\n  \"status\": \"ACTIVE\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/tenants/{{tenant_id_objetivo}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "tenants", "{{tenant_id_objetivo}}"]
        },
        "description": "Solo administrador de plataforma: usuario de la empresa de plataforma con el permiso tenants/manage (el admin sembrado lo tiene con */*). Cualquier otro usuario: 403 platform administrator required. PUT reemplaza nombre, código y estado: envía el estado actual para no cambiarlo. Cambiar el código afecta el próximo inicio de sesión con código. 400 estado inválido; 404 si no existe; 409 código duplicado o si se intenta suspender la empresa de plataforma."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Empresas: suspender",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/tenants/{{tenant_id_objetivo}}/suspend",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "tenants", "{{tenant_id_objetivo}}", "suspend"]
        },
        "description": "Solo administrador de plataforma: usuario de la empresa de plataforma con el permiso tenants/manage (el admin sembrado lo tiene con */*). Cualquier otro usuario: 403 platform administrator required. Bloquea el login y también los tokens vigentes de esa empresa (auth inmediato; facturación en máx. TENANT_STATUS_CACHE_SECONDS). 409 platform tenant cannot be suspended; 404 si no existe."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Empresas: activar",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/tenants/{{tenant_id_objetivo}}/activate",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "tenants", "{{tenant_id_objetivo}}", "activate"]
        },
        "description": "Solo administrador de plataforma: usuario de la empresa de plataforma con el permiso tenants/manage (el admin sembrado lo tiene con */*). Cualquier otro usuario: 403 platform administrator required. Los tokens aún vigentes vuelven a funcionar; 404 si no existe."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Permisos: catálogo",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/permissions/catalog",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "permissions", "catalog"]
        },
        "description": "Recursos y acciones válidos (MATRIZ_PERMISOS.md). Solo requiere autenticación."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Roles: listar",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/roles",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "roles"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere roles/read o rbac/manage (manage incluye read). Empresa del token."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Roles: crear",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Cajero\",\n  \"description\": \"Atiende pagos\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/roles",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "roles"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere roles/manage. 201 con el rol creado. 400 nombre vacío; 409 role name already exists (sin distinguir mayúsculas ni espacios)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Roles: consultar",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/roles/{{role_id}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "roles", "{{role_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere roles/read. 404 si no existe o es de otra empresa."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Roles: editar",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Cajero\",\n  \"description\": \"Atiende pagos y anulaciones\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/roles/{{role_id}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "roles", "{{role_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere roles/manage. 409 nombre repetido; 409 protected administrative role (rol admin sembrado)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Roles: eliminar",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/roles/{{role_id}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "roles", "{{role_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere roles/manage. 409 role is assigned to users (quítalo primero de los usuarios); sin usuarios se elimina con sus vínculos de permisos. 409 protected administrative role."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Permisos: listar",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/permissions",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "permissions"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere permissions/read o rbac/manage."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Permisos: crear",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"resource\": \"invoices\",\n  \"action\": \"read\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/permissions",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "permissions"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere permissions/manage. Se normaliza (minúsculas, sin espacios). 400 unknown permission resource/action; 409 permission already exists. Con comodín o tenants/manage: hay que cubrirlo (403)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Permisos: editar",
      "request": {
        "method": "PUT",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"resource\": \"invoices\",\n  \"action\": \"manage\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/permissions/{{permission_id}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "permissions", "{{permission_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere permissions/manage. 409 permission is assigned to roles; 409 protected administrative permission (*/* de la plataforma)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Permisos: eliminar",
      "request": {
        "method": "DELETE",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/permissions/{{permission_id}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "permissions", "{{permission_id}}"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere permissions/manage. 409 permission is assigned to roles; 409 protected administrative permission."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Asignaciones: asignar rol a usuario",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n  \"role_id\": \"{{role_id}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/rbac/users/roles/assign",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "rbac", "users", "roles", "assign"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere rbac/manage. Idempotente (200 sin duplicar). No escalar: quien opera debe cubrir con sus permisos lo que asigna o quita (403 cannot grant privileges you do not have)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Asignaciones: quitar rol a usuario",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"user_id\": \"{{user_id}}\",\n  \"role_id\": \"{{role_id}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/rbac/users/roles/remove",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "rbac", "users", "roles", "remove"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere rbac/manage. No escalar: quien opera debe cubrir con sus permisos lo que asigna o quita (403 cannot grant privileges you do not have). 409 operation would leave the tenant without an administrator."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Asignaciones: roles de un usuario",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/rbac/users/roles?user_id={{user_id}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "rbac", "users", "roles"],
          "query": [{ "key": "user_id", "value": "{{user_id}}" }]
        },
        "description": "Propio usuario: solo autenticación. Otro usuario: rbac/manage. Devuelve vínculos {TenantId, UserId, RoleId}."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Asignaciones: asignar permiso a rol",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"role_id\": \"{{role_id}}\",\n  \"permission_id\": \"{{permission_id}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/rbac/roles/permissions/assign",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "rbac", "roles", "permissions", "assign"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere rbac/manage. Idempotente. No escalar: quien opera debe cubrir con sus permisos lo que asigna o quita (403 cannot grant privileges you do not have)."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Asignaciones: quitar permiso a rol",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" },
          { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
          { "key": "Idempotency-Key", "value": "{{$guid}}" }
        ],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"role_id\": \"{{role_id}}\",\n  \"permission_id\": \"{{permission_id}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/rbac/roles/permissions/remove",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "rbac", "roles", "permissions", "remove"]
        },
        "description": "Requiere rbac/manage. No escalar: quien opera debe cubrir con sus permisos lo que asigna o quita (403 cannot grant privileges you do not have). 409 protected administrative role; 409 operation would leave the tenant without an administrator."
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "Asignaciones: permisos de un rol",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [
          { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{access_token}}" }
        ],
        "url": {
          "raw": "http://localhost:18080/api/v1/rbac/roles/permissions?role_id={{role_id}}",
          "protocol": "http",
          "host": ["localhost"],
          "port": "18080",
          "path": ["api", "v1", "rbac", "roles", "permissions"],
